<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>

  <!-- The Bubble Pipe kit (Utakata's soap-bubble pipe). Soap and breath only, no chakra. Every
       balance number is a field here or in AG_BubblePipe_Abilities.xml; the numbers are placeholders.

       The soap jar is part of the pipe: CompBubblePipe counts its blows, MapComponent_BubblePipe
       draws it on the holder's hip with its level showing and refills it while the holder stands on
       or next to a water cell. There is no ammunition item and no reload job.

       The parent is BaseWeapon, as the Power Pole's: the recipe is AG_MakeBubblePipe, and
       BaseWeapon's own comps (CompEquippable and the rest) are kept. No weaponTags, so raiders
       never carry it. -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="BaseWeapon">
    <defName>AG_BubblePipe</defName>
    <label>bubble pipe</label>
    <description>A bamboo blowpipe and a small jar of soap solution on a strap, worn at the hip. The jar holds 10 blows.\n\nWhile it is equipped, the wielder can use Drifting Burst and Eye Pop. Drifting Burst blows 6 bubbles that drift toward the target and burst on the first pawn to touch them, the wielder's allies included. Eye Pop bursts one bubble on a pawn's face and leaves soap in its eyes for a few seconds.\n\nThe jar refills, 1 blow per second, while the wielder stands on or next to water. In melee the pipe is a weak blunt poke.</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>RimArt/BubblePipe/BubblePipe</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <drawSize>1.0</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
    <techLevel>Medieval</techLevel>
    <smeltable>false</smeltable>
    <burnableByRecipe>true</burnableByRecipe>
    <relicChance>0</relicChance>
    <stackLimit>1</stackLimit>
    <thingCategories>
      <li>WeaponsMelee</li>
    </thingCategories>
    <weaponClasses>
      <li>Melee</li>
    </weaponClasses>
    <tradeability>All</tradeability>
    <statBases>
      <MarketValue>90</MarketValue>
      <Mass>0.6</Mass>
      <MaxHitPoints>60</MaxHitPoints>
      <Flammability>1</Flammability>
      <DeteriorationRate>2</DeteriorationRate>
      <Beauty>0</Beauty>
    </statBases>
    <comps>
      <li Class="RimArt.CompProperties_BubblePipe">
        <maxBlows>10</maxBlows>
        <refillPerSecond>1</refillPerSecond>
        <abilities>
          <li>AG_BubblePipe_DriftingBurst</li>
          <li>AG_BubblePipe_EyePop</li>
        </abilities>
      </li>
    </comps>
    <tools>
      <li>
        <label>pipe</label>
        <capacities><li>Blunt</li></capacities>
        <power>5</power>
        <cooldownTime>2</cooldownTime>
      </li>
    </tools>
  </ThingDef>

</Defs>
